1
00:00:06,382 --> 00:00:08,426
Cut the crap!

2
00:00:09,135 --> 00:00:12,262
I bet you're a monster too!

3
00:00:12,263 --> 00:00:13,514
Kondo!

4
00:00:18,769 --> 00:00:20,520
Hey, what are you doing?

5
00:00:20,521 --> 00:00:24,942
The Ashiharas. You guys too, huh?
Don't come any closer!

6
00:02:02,331 --> 00:02:03,998
{\an8}DEVILS' CREST

7
00:02:03,999 --> 00:02:08,170
{\an8}EPISODE 4: SUSPICION

8
00:02:09,755 --> 00:02:11,631
What are you talking about, Gamo?

9
00:02:11,632 --> 00:02:14,008
What makes you think we're monsters?

10
00:02:14,009 --> 00:02:16,636
There's no other explanation!

11
00:02:16,637 --> 00:02:19,807
You killed that massive
creature, didn't you?

12
00:02:20,391 --> 00:02:23,768
Anyone who can pull that off
has got to be a monster.

13
00:02:23,769 --> 00:02:27,230
We have injured people
inside the barricade.

14
00:02:27,231 --> 00:02:28,941
There's no way I'm letting you in!

15
00:02:29,567 --> 00:02:33,152
I think we might have better luck
negotiating with Ohno.

16
00:02:33,153 --> 00:02:34,821
I know what you're up to.

17
00:02:34,822 --> 00:02:37,615
You're gonna transform like Watamaki

18
00:02:37,616 --> 00:02:39,577
and attack us, aren't you?

19
00:02:42,788 --> 00:02:47,625
Ohno, you saw Watamaki transform?

20
00:02:47,626 --> 00:02:49,168
Yeah, I saw it.

21
00:02:49,169 --> 00:02:51,422
Everyone here saw the whole thing.

22
00:02:51,922 --> 00:02:54,341
Watamaki came out of the Caliculus,

23
00:02:54,884 --> 00:02:56,802
turned into a faceless monster,

24
00:02:57,344 --> 00:02:59,346
and attacked Beroshi.

25
00:02:59,930 --> 00:03:01,098
Did you guys...

26
00:03:01,807 --> 00:03:03,851
Did you just leave Beroshi to die?

27
00:03:04,935 --> 00:03:08,606
Kondo, shut your mouth.
You don't know what happened.

28
00:03:09,189 --> 00:03:11,608
Tada and Aida are in the shop
with serious injuries

29
00:03:11,609 --> 00:03:14,319
because of what Watamaki did to them.

30
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:18,072
<i>If Beroshi hadn't been there,
a lot more people would be dead.</i>

31
00:03:18,073 --> 00:03:20,451
<i>He put his life on the line
to keep us safe.</i>

32
00:03:20,951 --> 00:03:23,495
<i>There was no choice! We had to run!</i>

33
00:03:24,079 --> 00:03:27,498
Then we booked it to the lobby,

34
00:03:27,499 --> 00:03:31,003
only to find that huge monster
going on a rampage.

35
00:03:34,632 --> 00:03:36,424
<i>We carried Tada and Aida here</i>

36
00:03:36,425 --> 00:03:39,303
<i>and barely made it into this shop alive.</i>

37
00:03:39,887 --> 00:03:41,054
<i>Gamo's right.</i>

38
00:03:41,055 --> 00:03:44,475
<i>No normal human would stand a chance
against something that big.</i>

39
00:03:45,392 --> 00:03:50,605
So until you prove that you're
just as human as we are,

40
00:03:50,606 --> 00:03:52,650
we're not letting you past here.

41
00:03:53,692 --> 00:03:56,320
We've fought more than just
that pointy-headed freak.

42
00:03:57,613 --> 00:03:59,948
We also neutralized Watamaki

43
00:03:59,949 --> 00:04:01,825
when we found her in the Playroom.

44
00:04:02,409 --> 00:04:07,831
And we laid Miura to rest
inside a Caliculus.

45
00:04:10,459 --> 00:04:11,585
Beroshi...

46
00:04:12,211 --> 00:04:13,462
He's dead?

47
00:04:23,472 --> 00:04:24,431
Beroshi...

48
00:04:25,432 --> 00:04:27,308
Hey, he-twin.

49
00:04:27,309 --> 00:04:30,312
Forget about all that.
What did you mean "neutralized"?

50
00:04:33,023 --> 00:04:35,734
Forget about that?

51
00:04:36,443 --> 00:04:38,861
What did you do with Watamaki?

52
00:04:38,862 --> 00:04:41,447
Don't tell me you killed her!

53
00:04:41,448 --> 00:04:42,992
We didn't kill Watamaki.

54
00:04:43,492 --> 00:04:46,203
But it won't be easy...

55
00:04:47,579 --> 00:04:49,706
to explain what we did to her.

56
00:04:49,707 --> 00:04:52,208
Cut the crap. I knew it. You guys are--

57
00:04:52,209 --> 00:04:54,003
Gamo, shut up for a second!

58
00:05:00,092 --> 00:05:04,095
What was that? I'm the class rep.

59
00:05:04,096 --> 00:05:06,765
You're the one who needs to shut up!

60
00:05:15,858 --> 00:05:17,775
Some class rep you are.

61
00:05:17,776 --> 00:05:20,611
When Beroshi got attacked by Watamaki,

62
00:05:20,612 --> 00:05:22,948
you ran off without helping at all.

63
00:05:26,827 --> 00:05:29,704
And earlier, we were the ones
holding the barricade

64
00:05:29,705 --> 00:05:31,874
while you were cowering in the back.

65
00:05:36,336 --> 00:05:37,546
That was because...

66
00:05:39,048 --> 00:05:40,798
I'm the leader.

67
00:05:40,799 --> 00:05:44,052
If I go down, who's gonna
keep our class together?

68
00:05:44,053 --> 00:05:47,264
I'm the one who found
this safe zone for us!

69
00:05:50,559 --> 00:05:51,602
Okay, then.

70
00:05:52,436 --> 00:05:56,732
We'll deal with Kondo and the Ashiharas,
even if they might be monsters.

71
00:05:57,399 --> 00:06:00,527
The leader's supposed
to stay somewhere safe, right?

72
00:06:03,572 --> 00:06:07,868
If you wanna deal with them, be my guest.

73
00:06:08,452 --> 00:06:13,123
But don't let any of those three inside
no matter what.

74
00:06:18,504 --> 00:06:20,630
He called this a safe zone,

75
00:06:20,631 --> 00:06:23,383
but there's nothing safe about it.

76
00:06:23,967 --> 00:06:28,137
Hey, Yu, if another Conehead attacks,

77
00:06:28,138 --> 00:06:31,475
that barricade won't last ten seconds.

78
00:06:36,563 --> 00:06:37,397
Also...

79
00:06:38,315 --> 00:06:41,317
is that seriously the only thing
you had to wear?

80
00:06:41,318 --> 00:06:42,944
It's just a windbreaker.

81
00:06:42,945 --> 00:06:44,404
Oh, shut up.

82
00:06:44,988 --> 00:06:47,241
Ashihara, tell us what happened.

83
00:06:47,825 --> 00:06:49,784
What did you do with Watamaki?

84
00:06:49,785 --> 00:06:53,038
If you didn't kill her,
how'd you get her to stop attacking?

85
00:06:55,916 --> 00:06:57,042
I used magic.

86
00:07:17,646 --> 00:07:19,356
All right, let me try.

87
00:07:22,151 --> 00:07:23,109
Got it.

88
00:07:23,110 --> 00:07:24,194
What?

89
00:07:27,573 --> 00:07:29,574
So if we make our QRESTs like yours,

90
00:07:29,575 --> 00:07:31,784
we can pick up that hammer?

91
00:07:31,785 --> 00:07:32,828
Probably.

92
00:07:33,579 --> 00:07:34,954
How do we do it?

93
00:07:34,955 --> 00:07:36,706
Do we have to pay or something?

94
00:07:36,707 --> 00:07:38,333
There's no payment!

95
00:07:39,084 --> 00:07:40,169
I'll tell you how.

96
00:07:40,836 --> 00:07:44,046
But this is really important.

97
00:07:44,047 --> 00:07:45,841
I want to explain it to the whole class.

98
00:07:47,718 --> 00:07:51,013
Got it. I'll convince Gamo.

99
00:08:21,210 --> 00:08:23,754
<i>So, 17 people made it.</i>

100
00:08:24,796 --> 00:08:26,339
Where's everyone else?

101
00:08:26,340 --> 00:08:27,590
We don't know.

102
00:08:27,591 --> 00:08:31,844
Didn't everyone come down
from the second-floor Playroom together?

103
00:08:31,845 --> 00:08:34,722
No. The elevator wasn't working,

104
00:08:34,723 --> 00:08:36,891
and the stairs were packed like sardines.

105
00:08:36,892 --> 00:08:40,270
The ones in the back
went up to the third floor.

106
00:08:40,979 --> 00:08:42,689
<i>The girls were Fujikawa...</i>

107
00:08:43,565 --> 00:08:44,608
<i>...and Teragami.</i>

108
00:08:45,525 --> 00:08:47,277
<i>The boys were Niki,</i>

109
00:08:47,861 --> 00:08:49,738
<i>Haizaki, and the rest of that group.</i>

110
00:08:50,405 --> 00:08:51,949
The third floor...

111
00:08:53,659 --> 00:08:56,619
Even if there's another monster
on the third floor,

112
00:08:56,620 --> 00:09:00,957
I can't imagine Niki or Haizaki
going down that easily.

113
00:09:00,958 --> 00:09:03,125
Why'd you have to let them in?

114
00:09:03,126 --> 00:09:05,587
What are we going to do?
They're dangerous.

115
00:09:11,176 --> 00:09:14,804
So you said we could power up our QRESTs.

116
00:09:14,805 --> 00:09:16,098
How do we do it?

117
00:09:22,688 --> 00:09:25,648
Hey, don't drag this out. Tell us already.

118
00:09:25,649 --> 00:09:28,527
Yeah, we got other stuff to do.

119
00:09:51,341 --> 00:09:54,302
After we beat the pointy-headed monster,

120
00:09:54,303 --> 00:09:56,763
we checked things out at the entrance.

121
00:09:57,389 --> 00:10:00,224
We tried breaking the windows,
but nothing worked.

122
00:10:00,225 --> 00:10:03,728
Well, of course a shrimp
like you couldn't make a dent.

123
00:10:03,729 --> 00:10:05,313
It wasn't Yu.

124
00:10:05,314 --> 00:10:09,651
I slammed them with this hammer,
and they didn't even crack.

125
00:10:21,455 --> 00:10:23,081
I believe him.

126
00:10:23,999 --> 00:10:25,249
That idiot.

127
00:10:25,250 --> 00:10:29,338
It's probably not just the windows
and automatic doors that we can't break.

128
00:10:29,921 --> 00:10:32,340
All of the glass in the lobby
is pitch-black,

129
00:10:32,341 --> 00:10:34,300
so we can't see outside at all,

130
00:10:34,301 --> 00:10:36,303
and our QRESTs won't connect
to the network.

131
00:10:36,928 --> 00:10:41,015
In other words, unless we figure out
what's causing this,

132
00:10:41,016 --> 00:10:43,727
escaping Altea is impossible.

133
00:10:51,943 --> 00:10:56,155
So for now, we need to protect
the only shelter we have

134
00:10:56,156 --> 00:10:59,283
and give everyone here
the power to do that.

135
00:10:59,284 --> 00:11:00,702
That's our top priority.

136
00:11:01,203 --> 00:11:03,621
That's not your choice to make.

137
00:11:03,622 --> 00:11:06,499
I'm the class rep,
and I'm the one who found this place.

138
00:11:06,500 --> 00:11:09,878
So obviously, I'm the one
who decides what we do next!

139
00:11:11,088 --> 00:11:12,089
Ventus!

140
00:11:23,850 --> 00:11:24,851
Avis!

141
00:11:32,359 --> 00:11:33,527
Ignis!

142
00:11:48,875 --> 00:11:51,795
That was a spell, right?

143
00:11:52,629 --> 00:11:53,879
From Actual Magic.

144
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:56,591
No way. It was some kind of trick.

145
00:11:57,884 --> 00:11:59,136
I don't think so.

146
00:12:01,054 --> 00:12:03,557
I felt wind just now.

147
00:12:04,516 --> 00:12:07,977
QRESTs don't support
touch feedback by themselves,

148
00:12:07,978 --> 00:12:11,064
so if we felt the air move,
that wasn't AR.

149
00:12:11,815 --> 00:12:13,691
That wasn't a trick.

150
00:12:13,692 --> 00:12:15,651
It was real magic.

151
00:12:15,652 --> 00:12:20,656
Then did you use magic
to defeat that monster?

152
00:12:20,657 --> 00:12:23,659
Not just that thing. Watamaki too.

153
00:12:23,660 --> 00:12:24,910
No.

154
00:12:24,911 --> 00:12:27,288
We did kill the monster.

155
00:12:27,289 --> 00:12:28,415
But Watamaki...

156
00:12:29,666 --> 00:12:31,835
We just restrained her
so she couldn't move.

157
00:12:32,335 --> 00:12:36,673
I'm going to look for a way
to turn Watamaki back.

158
00:12:37,174 --> 00:12:38,591
Turn her back?

159
00:12:38,592 --> 00:12:40,594
Is that really possible?

160
00:12:41,178 --> 00:12:42,762
I think there might be a way.

161
00:12:43,597 --> 00:12:45,098
There's gotta be.

162
00:12:47,184 --> 00:12:48,101
All right.

163
00:12:49,060 --> 00:12:51,896
Ashihara, I believe you.

164
00:12:51,897 --> 00:12:54,648
From now on, I'll follow your orders.

165
00:12:54,649 --> 00:12:56,359
Thanks, Ohno.

166
00:12:58,195 --> 00:13:02,616
Okay, then.
I'll teach you all how to use magic.

167
00:13:08,955 --> 00:13:11,249
<i>Should I really do this?</i>

168
00:13:18,215 --> 00:13:19,299
Yu?

169
00:13:29,059 --> 00:13:31,353
All right, let's get started.

170
00:13:42,989 --> 00:13:45,199
Now everyone's changed

171
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:48,203
into the class they chose
during the Actual Magic playtest.

172
00:13:48,787 --> 00:13:49,787
Seriously?

173
00:13:49,788 --> 00:13:53,208
{\an8}YOICHI OHNO - HARUKI HOKARI
TAKESHI MORO - TAKATO SERA

174
00:13:53,959 --> 00:13:57,711
Mages and priests
should be able to use their spells,

175
00:13:57,712 --> 00:14:00,047
warriors should be stronger,

176
00:14:00,048 --> 00:14:02,842
and thieves and hunters
should be able to move faster.

177
00:14:11,685 --> 00:14:12,894
Ashihara.

178
00:14:13,520 --> 00:14:16,063
Sorry for treating you
like a monster earlier.

179
00:14:16,064 --> 00:14:18,691
No, I don't blame you at all.

180
00:14:18,692 --> 00:14:20,025
It's killing me, though.

181
00:14:20,026 --> 00:14:22,069
If we'd known this sooner,

182
00:14:22,070 --> 00:14:25,031
maybe we could've saved Beroshi.

183
00:14:28,368 --> 00:14:31,078
Why are you laughing?

184
00:14:31,079 --> 00:14:33,622
What else am I gonna do? A loss is a loss.

185
00:14:33,623 --> 00:14:35,332
They were the better team.

186
00:14:35,333 --> 00:14:36,792
But...

187
00:14:36,793 --> 00:14:39,128
Don't worry, Yoi.

188
00:14:39,129 --> 00:14:42,590
Someday, I'll be the best guard
in the league

189
00:14:42,591 --> 00:14:44,633
and help you win some games.

190
00:14:44,634 --> 00:14:45,927
Beroshi.

191
00:14:47,137 --> 00:14:48,679
Listen here, benchwarmer!

192
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:51,182
I'm the captain
and nobody talks down to me!

193
00:14:53,893 --> 00:14:55,186
All good, right?

194
00:15:00,150 --> 00:15:01,484
Beroshi!

195
00:15:02,152 --> 00:15:04,863
Go! Yoi!

196
00:15:05,363 --> 00:15:06,823
Ohno!

197
00:15:13,913 --> 00:15:16,165
Beroshi saved us all.

198
00:15:16,166 --> 00:15:18,376
We owe it to him to get out of here alive.

199
00:15:20,170 --> 00:15:21,420
Listen up for a second.

200
00:15:21,421 --> 00:15:25,425
If anyone here chose the priest class,
raise your hand.

201
00:15:26,926 --> 00:15:28,053
I did.

202
00:15:31,056 --> 00:15:32,474
Me too!

203
00:15:33,933 --> 00:15:35,560
Don't get cocky.

204
00:15:36,061 --> 00:15:38,020
Only three?

205
00:15:38,021 --> 00:15:40,648
Yeah. Fewer than I expected.

206
00:15:40,649 --> 00:15:42,274
Shimizu, Soga,

207
00:15:42,275 --> 00:15:45,653
and Moro should be able
to use healing magic.

208
00:15:45,654 --> 00:15:48,114
I want you to treat the injured.

209
00:15:49,032 --> 00:15:51,951
Right. We can heal them with magic.

210
00:15:56,289 --> 00:15:57,123
Moro.

211
00:15:58,291 --> 00:15:59,542
Yes?

212
00:16:01,211 --> 00:16:04,380
Please. Heal Tada and Aida.

213
00:16:04,381 --> 00:16:06,841
Beroshi gave his life to protect them.

214
00:16:08,134 --> 00:16:10,094
Ohno is asking Mo-yan a favor?

215
00:16:10,095 --> 00:16:11,763
I can't believe it.

216
00:16:13,640 --> 00:16:16,101
Okay. I'll give it a shot.

217
00:16:19,104 --> 00:16:20,730
Mo-yan's so cool!

218
00:16:21,606 --> 00:16:23,692
What was the spell again?

219
00:16:24,609 --> 00:16:26,569
Are you kidding me?

220
00:16:33,201 --> 00:16:34,202
Sacre!

221
00:16:40,166 --> 00:16:41,042
Premis!

222
00:16:43,628 --> 00:16:46,965
Fusione! Holy Healing!

223
00:16:58,852 --> 00:17:00,061
It doesn't hurt!

224
00:17:01,229 --> 00:17:02,771
Actually, it hurts a little.

225
00:17:02,772 --> 00:17:04,190
Wait, which is it?

226
00:17:05,775 --> 00:17:07,610
I'm fine, I'm fine.

227
00:17:08,570 --> 00:17:10,071
Magic is amazing!

228
00:17:10,697 --> 00:17:12,197
We did it!

229
00:17:12,198 --> 00:17:14,032
Next patient, please!

230
00:17:14,033 --> 00:17:16,786
You sound more like
a doctor than a priest.

231
00:17:21,666 --> 00:17:23,418
The pain is really gone!

232
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:25,962
Okay, but calm down!

233
00:17:27,547 --> 00:17:29,381
You're incredible, Mo-yan!

234
00:17:29,382 --> 00:17:30,633
I can't believe it!

235
00:17:32,469 --> 00:17:35,512
From this day forth,
you may call me Grand Priest.

236
00:17:35,513 --> 00:17:37,055
Don't get cocky.

237
00:17:37,056 --> 00:17:39,308
That really was amazing.

238
00:17:39,309 --> 00:17:41,310
Give me some tips later, okay?

239
00:17:41,311 --> 00:17:43,061
Me too, please.

240
00:17:43,062 --> 00:17:44,856
Nice going, Moro!

241
00:17:45,440 --> 00:17:46,482
You guys...

242
00:17:46,483 --> 00:17:48,526
We're counting on you, Grand Priest!

243
00:17:49,652 --> 00:17:50,944
Yep!

244
00:17:50,945 --> 00:17:52,113
Yu!

245
00:17:55,325 --> 00:17:56,701
What are those?

246
00:18:10,465 --> 00:18:12,133
Yu, keep it right there!

247
00:18:24,187 --> 00:18:26,064
What? Did that work?

248
00:18:26,689 --> 00:18:28,316
It was splash damage.

249
00:18:29,901 --> 00:18:33,488
Everyone, these bugs go down easy
if you hit them with something hard...

250
00:18:40,912 --> 00:18:43,413
We'll have to handle this ourselves.

251
00:18:43,414 --> 00:18:45,582
Sawa, kick the worms off.

252
00:18:45,583 --> 00:18:47,668
Konken, crush them with the hammer.

253
00:18:47,669 --> 00:18:48,919
Got it!

254
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:50,088
What about you?

255
00:18:50,588 --> 00:18:52,340
I'll do what I can with this.

256
00:18:58,555 --> 00:19:01,975
TABANUS HELLFLY LARVA

257
00:19:04,060 --> 00:19:05,061
We've got this!

258
00:19:14,821 --> 00:19:16,573
<i>Just seven or eight left.</i>

259
00:19:20,702 --> 00:19:23,453
Ashihara! Help Ruki!

260
00:19:23,454 --> 00:19:25,498
Hurry! Please!

261
00:19:37,385 --> 00:19:38,719
It's over.

262
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:40,387
Ruki!

263
00:19:40,388 --> 00:19:41,638
It's probably poison.

264
00:19:41,639 --> 00:19:43,348
Is he going to die?

265
00:19:43,349 --> 00:19:45,851
No, it's most likely a paralytic poison.

266
00:19:45,852 --> 00:19:47,145
Just wait a little.

267
00:19:47,687 --> 00:19:50,355
Ashihara, Tomori's...

268
00:19:50,356 --> 00:19:53,734
Tomochi protected me,

269
00:19:53,735 --> 00:19:56,361
and all I could do was run away.

270
00:19:56,362 --> 00:19:58,822
It's not your fault, Tsuda.

271
00:19:58,823 --> 00:20:01,284
I couldn't do anything either.

272
00:20:01,910 --> 00:20:04,620
Soga, can you use an antidote spell?

273
00:20:04,621 --> 00:20:06,830
Yeah. I think so.

274
00:20:06,831 --> 00:20:09,666
Then try it on Shimizu.

275
00:20:09,667 --> 00:20:10,960
Okay.

276
00:20:12,128 --> 00:20:13,171
Sacre.

277
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:14,964
Pluvia.

278
00:20:16,382 --> 00:20:17,592
Tersus.

279
00:20:18,885 --> 00:20:21,554
Holy Purification!

280
00:20:30,647 --> 00:20:32,357
Tomochi!

281
00:20:32,899 --> 00:20:34,650
Thank you, Soga.

282
00:20:34,651 --> 00:20:36,693
Thanks, Ashihara.

283
00:20:36,694 --> 00:20:37,903
Not at all.

284
00:20:37,904 --> 00:20:39,780
More importantly, once you can move,

285
00:20:39,781 --> 00:20:41,323
I need you and Soga to split up

286
00:20:41,324 --> 00:20:43,700
and cure everyone who's paralyzed.

287
00:20:43,701 --> 00:20:45,620
Okay. I'm fine now.

288
00:20:46,329 --> 00:20:47,663
Where's Moro?

289
00:20:47,664 --> 00:20:50,040
Moro's not here!

290
00:20:50,041 --> 00:20:52,335
Ashihara, over there.

291
00:21:08,017 --> 00:21:09,227
Mo-yan?

292
00:21:11,646 --> 00:21:13,313
What is that?

293
00:21:13,314 --> 00:21:15,108
A chrysalis?

294
00:21:16,651 --> 00:21:17,694
Konken, crush it!

295
00:21:22,365 --> 00:21:24,658
TABANUS HELLFLY

296
00:21:24,659 --> 00:21:28,203
Ten seconds later and it would've hatched.

297
00:21:28,204 --> 00:21:30,163
You okay, Moro?

298
00:21:30,164 --> 00:21:32,207
You're safe now.

299
00:21:32,208 --> 00:21:36,128
Shimizu or Soga can heal you right away.

300
00:21:36,129 --> 00:21:38,089
Can you get up, Mo-yan?

301
00:21:46,681 --> 00:21:47,849
What's wrong?

302
00:21:48,558 --> 00:21:49,767
He's dead!

303
00:23:27,990 --> 00:23:28,907
DEVIL

304
00:23:28,908 --> 00:23:30,158
<i>Protect them at all costs.</i>

305
00:23:30,159 --> 00:23:31,618
<i>Guess we didn't need this many.</i>

306
00:23:31,619 --> 00:23:34,830
<i>Who gave you the right to boss us around?</i>

307
00:23:34,831 --> 00:23:35,956
<i>Ratio is going up.</i>

308
00:23:35,957 --> 00:23:36,957
<i>I saw it.</i>

309
00:23:36,958 --> 00:23:39,251
<i>After that, he helped Sera and Hokari.</i>

310
00:23:39,252 --> 00:23:40,794
<i>Something's seriously wrong here!</i>

311
00:23:40,795 --> 00:23:42,922
<i>Nice to meet you, Yuumy.</i>

